re><p>法國41萬人上街頭表達不滿　爆警民衝突將近千人被捕</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:06.980099+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1635,"images":18,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:14:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:34.694124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:55.045818+00:00","content_hash":"820c22e14a5d3151dc9e0f9fbdb437c3fcc1d1982a61442b5d865d1982e03c51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}